sections: INPUT, OUTPUT, COMMENTS, STAMPS!!
{
	!! FOOP-33: bare unanchored backward search (?pattern with nothing before the ?).
	!! Bug 1: parser hardcoded the anchor to a literal empty Brane{} instead of
	!! "no anchor" -- so a bare ?pattern always scanned zero statements and
	!! settled NK, never finding anything, regardless of pattern correctness.
	!! Bug 2 (already fixed on this branch, pinned again here): name-search
	!! matching must use the full characterized name (searchable_name), not
	!! just the bare coordinate, so a pattern containing ' can match.

	!! (1) Bread and butter: found in the CURRENT brane (IB) -- x is a
	!! sibling statement earlier in this same brane.
	x = 3;
	local_hit = ?x;

	!! (2) Characterized name, found in the current brane via bare backward
	!! search -- pins Bug 2 in the same scope Bug 1 is pinned.
	tag'y = 5;
	plain_y = 9;
	quoted_hit = ?tag'y;
	quoted_miss = ?y;

	!! (3) Miss in the current brane: no candidate named this way exists
	!! anywhere reachable, so it must settle ECONSTANIC (unanchored miss),
	!! not NK -- an anchored miss (a?pattern) is what settles NK; the bare
	!! form may still gain a value later via recoordination.
	miss = ?nonexistent;

	!! (4) A reference to (3)'s ECONSTANIC result, itself found via another
	!! backward-pattern search, must become WOCONSTANIC: it found its
	!! dependency (miss's statement), but that dependency is not yet a
	!! concrete value -- it should not settle further on its own.
	miss_ref = ?miss;

	!! (5) Ancestor climb: 'deep' is defined in the outer brane BEFORE the
	!! inner'{...} statement. Inside the inner brane, ?deep has no local
	!! candidate, so the bare search must climb via AB to the position of
	!! inner'{...} in the outer brane and scan backward from there.
	deep = 11;
	inner'{
		found_in_ancestor = ?deep;
	};
}
!!
{WOCONSTANIC
  x=3;
  localˍhit=3;
  tag'y=5;
  plainˍy=9;
  quotedˍhit=5;
  quotedˍmiss=?(pattern='y', UNANCHORED, ECONSTANIC);
  miss=?(pattern='nonexistent', UNANCHORED, ECONSTANIC);
  missˍref=?(result=?(pattern='nonexistent', UNANCHORED, ECONSTANIC), pattern='miss', UNANCHORED, WOCONSTANIC);
  deep=11;
  inner'{
    foundˍinˍancestor=11
  }
}!!
!!
